  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical &amp; Strategic Advisory Support to the FDW Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment provides technical and strategic advisory services to the Sustainable Water Fund (FDW) programme implemented by RVO on behalf of the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs. The consultancy supports knowledge exchange, policy dialogue, and strategic positioning of the FDW public&#x2013;private partnership programme by analysing its added value, documenting lessons learned, and strengthening knowledge management and sector engagement. The assignment also contributes to key activities such as policy briefs, stakeholder engagement, and the organisation of an FDW symposium to enhance the programme&#x2019;s impact and visibility.</narrative>
  </description>
